1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:05,800
AI agents are now capable of managing enterprise operations.

2
00:00:05,900 --> 00:00:11,500
But giving an autonomous agent a private key to your treasury creates an unacceptable financial catastrophe risk.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:17,200
A single prompt injection or hallucinated invoice can drain millions in seconds.

4
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:23,800
Yet requiring human approval on every routine twenty-dollar invoice destroys the value of autonomy.

5
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:28,800
Introducing Kitro: policy-controlled autonomous treasury infrastructure on XRPL.

6
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:32,500
Kitro separates intelligence from financial authorization.

7
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:38,000
The AI agent interprets the invoice and proposes the payment.

8
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:44,500
An independent referee checks the supplier allowlist, per-payment caps, and daily spending capacity.

9
00:00:44,600 --> 00:00:53,800
With both signatures collected, XRPL native 2-of-2 multisig settles the transaction in three seconds.

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:59,500
What if the agent is compromised? The policy referee refuses the transaction before signing.

11
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:05,800
Even if a rogue agent broadcasts directly to the ledger, XRPL quorum rules reject the transaction.

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:10,200
With Kitro, AI handles the work. You keep control of the money.

13
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:15,000
Kitro. Autonomous finance, controlled by policy.
